# Throwaway driver scripts — walking a flow in a real browser to see whether
# the product works is routine here, and those scripts are notes, not code.
# Committing them would leave the repo littered with half-finished probes
# that read like tests and are not maintained as any.
_scratch_*.mjs
# throwaway configs and build scripts agents write while the real ones are
# held by somebody else — never part of the product
.scratch-*
.pw-scratch.*
drive-*.mjs
walk*.mjs
